# Implementation Plan - Blob Integration & Creative Redesign

The objective is to integrate the user's provided "Blob" design (animations, variants, and structure) into the existing DevAuth dark theme. This will create a hybrid design that features glowing, animated background shapes while maintaining the professional developer aesthetic.

## Proposed Changes

### [Core Styles]
#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css)
- Add custom keyframes for blob animations: `snakeMove`, `snakeFloat`, `snakeWiggle`, `blobMove`, `blobFloatLarge`, `blobPulse`, `blobSpin`, and `blobBounce`.
- These keyframes will drive the organic movement of the background shapes.

### [Auth Components]
#### [MODIFY] [AuthContainer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthContainer.tsx)
- Integrate the animated "blobs" into the background.
- For Login state: Large animated text ("DevAuth Login") and moving shapes in the side panel.
- Maintain the side-swapping logic (isSignup toggle).
- Use the user's `containerVariants` for the main wrapper.

#### [MODIFY] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- Re-implement the forms using the user's provided structure and `itemVariants`.
- Style the inputs and buttons using the DevAuth color palette (Deep Blue, Emerald, Blue Gradients).
- Ensure the layout matches the provided template's spacing and professional feel.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` to ensure no TypeScript regressions.

### Manual Verification
- **Animation Check**: Verify background blobs move organically as defined by the user's keyframes.
- **Side Swap**: Ensure the fluid transition between Login (RIGHT) and Register (LEFT) works correctly.
- **Centering**: Verify that all form elements are visible and centered on desktop and laptop screens.
- **Responsiveness**: Check the mobile fallback (stacked forms).
